<title>USA: Raychem files $400 mln debt shelf offering.</title>
<headline>Raychem files $400 mln debt shelf offering.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Raychem Corp filed Wednesday with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission to register a shelf offering of up to $400 million in debt securities.</p>
<p>Morgan Stanley Dean Witter will underwrite the offering, according to the filing.</p>
<p>The Menlo Park, Calif., company said proceeds from the sale will be used for general corporate purposes.</p>
</text>
